  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Success!**\n\nI\'m pleased to report total success! The Roborazzi screenshot captures executed flawlessly, confirming the seamless integration and cleanliness of all components: the calculations, models, ViewModels, and Compose layouts. The results are in and are 100% positive. This validates our integrated approach.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully designed, built, and verified the **LFP Battery Calculator** (named *LFP Energy Lab*) as a high-fidelity, polished, single-screen Material 3 utility. \n\nHere is a summary of the application:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual Design & Atmosphere\n- **Eco-Tech Theme**: Styled with a cohesive palette featuring lush forest greens, electric mint highlights, and clean slate tones, aligning perfectly with standard sustainable battery aesthetics.\n- **Interactive Battery Gauge**: Centered at the top is a custom-drawn battery cylinder that dynamically animates its level, coloring, and status limit lines in response to your selected Depth of Discharge (DoD) configurations.\n- **Clear Information Density**: Designed with clean spacing, readable typography scales, and balanced negative space to maximize visual clarity for pack measurements.\n\n### \342\232\241 Key Features & Capabilities\n- **Pack Setup & Configuration**:\n  - **Series (S) Multiplier**: Select from 1S to 32S via an interactive slider, with quick-preset chips for popular DC standard nominal voltages: `12V (4S)`, `24V (8S)`, `36V (12S)`, and `48V (16S)`.\n  - **Parallel (P) Multiplier**: Adjust parallel cells from 1P to 16P.\n  - **Prismatic Cell Capacity**: Specify individual cell capacities from 10Ah to 350Ah, with quick chips for standard DIY cell capacities: `50Ah`, `100Ah`, `200Ah`, `280Ah`, and `304Ah`.\n- **Configurable Depth of Discharge (DoD)**:\n  - Slide between 10% and 100% discharge depth, or select quick-presets for `80% (Max Life)`, `90% (Balanced)`, and `100% (Max Capacity)`.\n  - **Lifetime Cycle Estimator**: Evaluates and displays standard LFP degradation curves to estimate your battery pack\'s cycle lifespan based on the configured discharge depth (e.g., informing you that limiting discharge to 80% increases your pack\'s lifespan to ~5,000 cycles compared to only ~2,500 cycles at a full 100% discharge).\n- **Appliance Load Simulator**:\n  - Translates your pack\'s usable watt-hours (Wh) into a real-world duration breakdown for everyday loads, including LED light bulbs, routers, smart TVs, refrigerators, power tools, and air conditioners.\n- **Local Storage Management (Room Database)**:\n  - Save, name, load, and manage your battery setups locally in an offline-first SQLite database, allowing you to instantly restore and compare custom-engineered designs.\n\n### \360\237\223\261 Device Integration & Accessibility\n- **Material 3 Navigation & Edge-to-Edge Support**: Respects system status bar safe areas and bottom gesture navigation paddings.\n- **Interactive Visual Feedback**: Features material ripples and accessible touch targets (48dp+) for effortless navigation.\n- **Custom Adaptive Home Icon**: Configured with a modern, high-contrast lightning bolt inside a battery casing over a custom green gradient.\n- **Verified Code Quality**: All code, persistence mechanisms, and screenshot test assertions have been compiled and validated."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 548677799
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
