    user_response: "Implement a selection UI that allows users to choose different LFP battery types (cylindrical/prismatic) and capacities (15Ah to 314Ah), and automatically link these to their expected cycle life data.\nImplement local data persistence to save the user\'s current device selection and calculation results so they remain available after closing the app, ensuring offline functionality."
