s on the canvas. Now, I\'m defining the orange lightning bolt\'s vertices. I\'ve started with a top-right coordinate of (63, 38). Next, I need to decide on the path data: horizontal or angled? The design calls for a sharp, modern appearance. I\'m carefully analyzing each line segment to ensure the bolt\'s shape is perfect. I want to finalize the path from the top right to bottom left.\n\n\n**Verifying the Coordinates**\n\nI\'ve just finished verifying the coordinates for the lightning bolt and ensured the path segments are proportionate and balanced. Analyzing the path segments confirms the design\'s symmetry. I\'m focusing on the delta-x and delta-y values, and visualizing the key points to ensure the final shape is correct.\n\n\n"
