  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the String Mapping**\n\nI\'m making great headway, I believe! My idea is to construct a clear mapping for all the languages and strings we\'ll need. I\'m planning to create a specific file within the app\'s source code to host this elegant structure. I can see it clearly already, I think this approach is excellent.\n\n\n**Refining the Translation Structure**\n\nI\'ve been further refining the structure for string localization. I\'ve shifted from considering a class to a dictionary-based map approach for the `BatteryLocalizer`. The goal is simplicity and efficiency. It is now a straightforward map for translations. I\'ve started defining languages and am working on fleshing out UI text translations to create an exhaustive map structure.\n\n\n**Compiling the Language Keys**\n\nI\'ve been creating the keys, and I\'ve got a good start! I\'ve now defined the keys needed across five languages. I have compiled all the keys, and mapped their English translations. I\'ve begun to translate the keys for use within the app, and am actively working on the French, Spanish, German, and Chinese versions. The translation process is underway and the basic structure is now in place.\n\n\n**Expanding the UI Translations**\n\nI\'m now focusing on expanding the UI translations. I have added several new entries to the translation map, including strings for \"Configure LFP Battery Pack,\" \"LFP Pack Settings,\" and \"Pack Performance Analysis.\" I\'m also including descriptions and details about configuring the pack such as required pack size, pack analysis, and more. I\'m adding these strings to the translation map.\n\n\n**Adding UI Labels**\n\nI\'m presently adding UI labels for a number of new UI elements. I\'ve integrated strings like \"Required Energy (Wh):\" for `required_energy_wh`, \"Estimated Backup Time:\" for `estimated_backup`, and \"Estimated Lifespan:\" for `estimated_lifespan`. I\'ve added a few UI strings for solar and grid setup, recommendations for core equipment, safe connections, and some accessory options. I\'ve also added strings for displaying a disclaimer regarding solar calculations, as well as saved designs.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will create a localization file `/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/BatteryLocalizer.kt` that defines the translation dictionaries for English, Bengali, Chinese, German, and Korean, and exposes helper functions to retrieve localized strings dynamically based on the persisted language setting."
