  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Complete Matching**\n\nI\'ve confirmed a perfect match between metadata and the resource file name: \"LFP Battery Calculator\". My final check involves confirming full translation, offline capability, and storage of user preferences like appliance selection and language. It appears that everything is aligned, completing this task with a high degree of confidence.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed the implementation, localization, and branding of the **LFP Battery Calculator** application. The app builds and runs perfectly with a successful Gradle compile status.\n\nBelow is a detailed overview of the completed work:\n\n### 1. Robust Multilingual Localization\nThe application is now fully localized across five languages: **English**, **Bengali (\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\202\340\246\262\340\246\276)**, **Chinese (\344\270\255\346\226\207)**, **German (Deutsch)**, and **Korean (\355\225\234\352\265\255\354\226\264)**. \n- **Centralized Localization System**: Integrated localization across all four main tabs:\n  - **Load Estimator & Appliance Selection**: Dynamic inputs, item quantities, backup hours, and system total metrics.\n  - **Battery Configuration & Curves**: Cell specifications, series/parallel configuration, Depth of Discharge (DoD) sliders, cycle life estimation, and battery pack characteristics.\n  - **Solar & Grid Sizing Guide**: Selection between **Off-grid**, **On-grid**, and **Hybrid** systems with corresponding design explanations, advantages, and limitations.\n  - **Saved Designs History**: List of saved configurations, system parameters, and design notes.\n- **Persistent Preferences**: Any language selected by the user in the settings menu is saved locally and will automatically load upon subsequent launches of the application.\n\n### 2. High-Quality Custom App Icon (Adaptive Design)\n- **Visual Identity**: Replaced the default launcher icon with a premium, custom vector-designed adaptive icon.\n- **Foreground Composition**: Features a modern, deep blue lithium-iron-phosphate (LFP) prismatic cell outline with a vibrant gold lightning bolt overlay.\n- **Safe Zone Centering**: Designed within a strict 66dp inner-circle safe-zone over a sleek linear gradient background transitioning diagonally from dark slate blue to charcoal black.\n\n### 3. Sizing Guidelines & Solar/Grid Sizing Formulas\n- **Dynamic Calculator**: Sizing recommendations (inverters, DC wiring gauge, battery cell config, solar PV array peak capacity) dynamically update based on the estimated backup power and total watt-hours specified in the load tab.\n- **Comprehensive Sizing Manual**: Offers clear explanations of off-grid vs. on-grid and hybrid architectures, assisting users in selecting the exact materials, fuses, and setups needed for their homes.\n\n### 4. Seamless Offline Performance & Persistence\n- **Room Database Integration**: Saved battery pack specifications, cell details, and customized configurations are safely written to a local SQLite database, offering unlimited retrieval even when offline.\n- **User Preference Memory**: Selected household appliances, quantities, and target backup durations are immediately cached, allowing users to return to their work exactly where they left it."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 746841572
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
