    user_response: "Implement a simple unit conversion utility within the app to toggle between different capacity measurements commonly used in battery tech.\nCreate a screen component for calculating LFP battery total energy by multiplying Ah (Ampere-hours) by Voltage.\nUse a charting library to implement a visualization component showing the voltage discharge curve based on standard LFP battery characteristics."
