    thinking: "**Importing Canvas Elements**\n\nI\'ve made good headway by importing several relevant Canvas-related classes, like `Canvas`, `CornerRadius`, `Offset`, and `Size`. I\'m starting to build a basic framework to work with the composable elements. Now I can start to explore how to implement that library to use for data visualizations.\n\n\n**Adding Gesture Interaction**\n\nI\'ve incorporated brush and color imports to handle graphics. It now looks like I need some gesture-related imports for touch interactivity, and I am leaning towards using `pointerInput` with `detectDragGestures` and `detectTapGestures` for a very smooth user experience. I\'ve also added `Path` and other associated graphics imports.\n\n\n**Refining Graphics Imports**\n\nI\'m currently verifying the existing imports related to graphics. The initial import of `androidx.compose.ui.graphics.*` seems incomplete. I\'ve located the lines in `BatteryCalculatorScreen.kt` and decided to add any missing explicit imports there, rather than rely on the wildcard. The goal is cleaner and more precise code. Additionally, I\'m examining the `BatteryLocalizer.kt` translations for Bengali and English and planning to add new localization keys as needed.\n\n**Updating Tab Navigation**\n\nI\'ve reviewed the current tab selection logic and list of tabs. I\'ve updated the mutable state for the active tab, adding a new option: \"LFP Pro Tools\". This change will be reflected in the tab navigation to incorporate the new functionality. I\'m focusing on ensuring this addition integrates seamlessly with the existing tab structure.\n\n\n**Defining Localization Keys**\n\nI\'ve begun designing the localization keys for the new \"LFP Pro Tools\" tab. I\'m starting with English, defining keys for the tab title, the tool title, and descriptions for the energy calculator. I\'ve included translations for cell capacity, voltage, and the calculations for pack voltage, capacity, total energy (Wh/kWh), and the lead-acid comparison section. I\'ve also added the beginning of keys for the unit converter.\n\n\n**Expanding Localization Keys**\n\nI\'ve added localization keys related to the unit converter. \"Battery Capacity Unit Converter,\" \"Quickly convert capacity values across battery metrics,\" \"From Unit,\" \"To Unit,\" \"Enter Value:,\" and \"Converted Result:\" are now defined. Also included are discharge curve titles, descriptions, and labels for SoC, cell voltage, and pack voltage. Finally, I\'ve added Bengali translations for \"LFP Pro Tools\" and calculator sections.\n\n\n**Translating Bengali Keys**\n\nI am now translating Bengali localization keys for the LFP Pro Tools section. I\'ve successfully translated \"Calculate Energy,\" \"Cell Capacity (Ah),\" \"Nominal Cell Voltage (V),\" \"Total Pack Voltage,\" \"Total Pack Capacity,\" \"Total Energy (Wh),\" \"Total Energy (kWh),\" \"Lead-Acid Comparison,\" and the description for the lead-acid comparison to Bengali. This brings more accessibility to the tool.\n\n\n**Adding Bengali Translations**\n\nI\'ve just added several more Bengali translations to the localization keys. These include: \"Equivalent Lead-Acid Size,\" \"Battery Capacity Unit Converter,\" \"Quickly convert capacity values across battery metrics,\" \"From Unit,\" \"To Unit,\" \"Enter Value:,\" and \"Converted Result:.\" I\'ve also added keys for the discharge curve, including title, description, and labels for SoC. I am working to translate any remaining keys.\n\n\n"
