**Pack Voltage (V)** dynamically.\n\n*   **\360\237\224\204 Battery Capacity Unit Converter**:\n    *   **Multivariate Support**: Convert capacity metrics across **Ah, Wh, kWh, Joules, MegaJoules, and BTUs**.\n    *   **Dynamic Voltage Integration**: Seamlessly calculates and handles conversion paths involving Ampere-hours ($Ah$) and power metrics ($Wh$, Joules, BTUs) by dynamically factoring in the nominal system voltage.\n\n*   **\360\237\214\215 Language Localization**:\n    *   Includes complete, high-quality translation strings for both **English** and **Bengali (\340\246\254\340\246\276\340\246\202\340\246\262\340\246\276)**, ensuring flawless terminology and zero linguistic mix-ups. Safe fallback handling ensures seamless operation across Chinese, German, and Korean environments as well!"
